OL,3,GNEWSAEx-footballer and charity founder
OL,4,Areceives MBE
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Manchester United player and
OL,7,FStoke City manager who launched a
OL,8,Fhomeless charity 10 years ago has
OL,9,Freceived his MBE from the Prince of
OL,10,FWales.
OL,12,FLou Macari, who founded the Macari
OL,13,FFoundation, was recognised in the
OL,14,FKing's Birthday Honours for his
OL,15,Ffootball career and dedication to
OL,16,Ftackling homelessness.
OL,18,FHe received his medal from Prince
OL,19,FWilliam during an investiture at
OL,20,FWindsor Castle on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
